<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2098" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶ</span></b>  (authorities vary, cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.496
		</span></i>, Tz.ad<i><span class="en">
			Lyc.
			31
		</span></i>), interj. of astonishment or grief:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἲ τάλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					706
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Min. Oxy.</u>
				413.73
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἲ τὸν Ἄδωνιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bion
					1.32
				</span></i>
			; freq. doubled <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰαῖ</span>
				(Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.933
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1341
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				787
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰαῖ τόλμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					814
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1007
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.67
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰαῖ Ἄδωνιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					393
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				1.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰαῖ πέτρον ἐκεῖνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.554
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.424
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Duris
			</span></i> Elait.). [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αῐαῑ</span> generally,
			sometimes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αῑαῑ</span>, as <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.]</div>
